  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 1502.25 Gravel wetland",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1502.25 “Gravel wetland” means a horizontal-flow filtration system that relies on a dense root mat, crushed stone, and a microbe-rich environment to treat stormwater.\n\nSource. #9343, eff 1-1-09; ss by #12342, eff 8-15-17 (formerly Env-Wq 1502.23); ss by #14472, eff 1-19-26, EXPIRES: 1-19-36 (formerly Env-Wq 1502.27)",
